        "tree_id": "ab25bc4e795b27495a1c76fcfd467828334829c9",
        "message": "Update project dependencies and enhance feature documentation\n\n- Updated package-lock.json to include version 0.1.0 and upgraded Next.js to 16.4.0.\n- Added new dependencies including @simplewebauthn/browser and grpcio.\n- Enhanced feature-register.json with detailed implementation, migration files, API contracts, and evidence for features P02-F01 and P02-F02.\n- Updated phase-register.json to reflect the acceptance status of Phase 01 and progress on Phase 02.\n- Modified Dockerfile to pin the base image to python:3.12-slim-trixie and included observe.py.\n- Improved session management in session.ts to handle revoked authentication sessions.\n- Added new error and notice messages in messages.ts for better user feedback.\n- Updated web application components to include new identity provider features and access management.",
